    "confidence_notes": "SAM-platform game using PinMAME ROM (smanve_101 Vault Edition). Manual trough via 4 VPX kickers (Trough1-4) with Controller.Switch calls, not cvpmTrough. Sandman VUK (sw59/sol12) and Doc Ock VUK (sw36/sol4) use cvpmSaucer. Doc Ock magnet on sol3. 3 flippers (2 lower + 1 upper right). Drop target bank (3-bank) on sol20 uses position switches 49/50. Sandman motor (sol13) uses position switches 53/54. Doc Ock motor (sol5) uses position switches 57/58. GI is callback-driven (GIUpdate2). Lamps use nFozzy VPMLampUpdater (Lampz) with MassAssign — VPX object names (l3, p3on, etc.) are VPX editor primitives not defined in script. Flasher solenoids (21,23,25-31) use SolModCallback for PWM control. Some map to named VPX flasher objects (Flasherlight1-4). Lamp IDs 74-77 control GI color mode (Sandman/Venom/Goblin/Octopus spots). UseVPMModSol=2, UseSolenoids=1, UseLamps=0. TiltSwitch=-7 (active low)."
  },
